## 🔬 2. Engineering Feasibility & Physics Validation

* **Core Siphon Feasibility (MHD Integration):** **High.** Tapping the kinetic fluid speed of the lightning arc before it collapses completely transforms system yield. The 5-Tesla superconducting magnetic field splits the ionic channel cleanly, siphoning the vast majority of the capture without physical electrode melting.
* **Thermal Feasibility (Molten Salt Gravity Loop):** **High.** Utilizing a passive FLiNaK molten salt convective loop at atmospheric pressure completely avoids the high corrosion and explosion risks of liquid sodium. The graphite matrix cleanly transfers the buffered thermal energy to fuel the thermoacoustic engine below.
* **Mechanical Feasibility (6-Node Buffer Lattice):** **High.** The interlocking non-contact magnetic gear array ensures frictionless torque routing through a vacuum environment. Alternating the rotor spin axes cancels macro-scale torsional strains, keeping the granite anchor vault perfectly secure.
* **Refining Integration Feasibility (Co-Location):** **Exceptional.** Eliminating cross-mountain high-voltage physical grid cables or heavy road-bound BESS transportation fleets protects the business model from geopolitical vulnerabilities, mountain line erosion, and severe weather infrastructure collapse.

